From: Stephen Kent <43362477+kentstephen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 14:43:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] read_zarr: ranges= coordinate-bound chunk pruning and row
 clipping

ranges=['dim:lo:hi', ...] prunes work units whose coordinate min/max miss
the bounds and clips rows inside kept chunks (inclusive bounds). Unit tests
cover the boundary cases docs/design.md lists; SQL tests check equivalence
with a plain WHERE by EXCEPT.
